<float_number>|100)\0A      Non-translation motion components weight. The default is 100.\0A\0A  --deblur=(yes|no)\0A      Do deblurring.\0A  --deblur-sens=<float_number>\0A      Set deblurring sensitivity (from 0 to +inf). The default is 0.1.\0A\0A  -t=, --trim-ratio=<float_number>\0A      Set trimming ratio (from 0 to 0.5). The default is 0.1.\0A  -et=, --est-trim=(yes|no)\0A      Estimate trim ratio automatically. The default is yes.\0A  -ic=, --incl-constr=(yes|no)\0A      Ensure the inclusion constraint is always satisfied. The default is no.\0A\0A  -bm=, --border-mode=(replicate|reflect|const)\0A      Set border extrapolation mode. The default is replicate.\0A\0A  --mosaic=(yes|no)\0A      Do consistent mosaicking. The default is no.\0A  --mosaic-stdev=<float_number>\0A      Consistent mosaicking stdev threshold. The default is 10.0.\0A\0A  -mi=, --motion-inpaint=(yes|no)\0A      Do motion inpainting (requires CUDA support). The default is no.\0A  --mi-dist-thresh=<float_number>\0A      Estimated flow distance threshold for motion inpainting. The default is 5.0.\0A\0A  -ci=, --color-inpaint=(no|average|ns|telea)\0A      Do color inpainting. The default is no.\0A  --ci-radius=<float_number>\0A      Set color inpainting radius (for ns and telea options only).\0A      The default is 2.0\0A\0A  -ws=, --wobble-suppress=(yes|no)\0A      Perform wobble suppression. The default is no.\0A  --ws-lp=(yes|no)\0A      Turn on/off LP based motion estimation. The default is no.\0A  --ws-period=<int_number>\0A      Set wobble suppression period. The default is 30.\0A  --ws-model=(transl|transl_and_scale|rigid|similarity|affine|homography)\0A      Set wobble suppression motion model (must have more DOF than motion \0A      estimation model). The default is homography.\0A  --ws-subset=(<int_number>|auto)\0A      Number of random samples per one motion hypothesis. The default is auto.\0A  --ws-thresh=(<float_number>|auto)\0A      Maximum error to classify match as inlier. The default is auto.\0A  --ws-outlier-ratio=<float_number>\0A      Motion estimation outlier ratio hypothesis. The default is 0.5.\0A  --ws-min-inlier-ratio=<float_number>\0A      Minimum inlier ratio to decide if estimated motion is OK. The default is 0.1.\0A  --ws-nkps=<int_number>\0A      Number of keypoints to find in each frame. The default is 1000.\0A  --ws-local-outlier-rejection=(yes|no)\0A      Perform local outlier rejection. The default is no.\0A\0A  -sm2=, --save-motions2=(<file_path>|no)\0A      Save motions estimated for wobble suppression. The default is no.\0A  -lm2=, --load-motions2=(<file_path>|no)\0A      Load motions for wobble suppression from file. The default is no.\0A\0A  -gpu=(yes|no)\0A      Use CUDA optimization whenever possible. The default is no.\0A\0A  -o=, --output=(no|<file_path>)\0A      Set output file path explicitly. The default is stabilized.avi.\0A  --fps=(<float_number>|auto)\0A      Set output video FPS explicitly. By default the source FPS is used (auto).\0A  -q, --quiet\0A      Don't show output video frames.\0A\0A  -h, --help\0A      Print help.\0A\0ANote: some argument configurations lead to two passes, some to single pass.\0A\0A\00", align 1
